# Nested repos with independent git histories — managed separately, not tracked here.
# hello_eink is the product (remote: glmoritz/zephyr_eink_waveshare).
# labsc_lora holds every LoRa application under apps/ (remote: glmoritz/labsc_lora).
#   It absorbed the former labsc_zephyr_lorawan repo (= lorawan_uplink), which
#   had vendored the same two USP submodule commits as lorawan_lrfhss; that repo
#   is now archival. All four app histories are preserved inside labsc_lora.
# labsc_filament_oven is the oven controller (remote: glmoritz/labsc_filament_oven).
# openocd-esp32 and Zephyr_ESP32S3-N16R8 are vendored upstream clones.
# See backup/workspace-fossil-pre-split-2026-05-19.bundle for pre-split history.
/workspace/projects/hello_eink/
/workspace/projects/labsc_lora/
/workspace/projects/labsc_filament_oven/
/workspace/openocd-esp32/
/workspace/apps/Zephyr_ESP32S3-N16R8/
